{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026v7XdqoHBl71793589761.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>財政司司長陳茂波於香港女總裁峰會致辭，預告周二將公布第三季經濟數據，很大機會上調今年全年經濟增長預測。</p><p></p><p>財政司司長陳茂波表示︰「本港經濟在今年上半年增長百分之5.1。明日我們將公布第三季數據，將標誌連續第15個季度錄得增長。我們亦很大機會上調全年經濟增長預測，令香港有望創下5年來最強勁的年度增長。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:21:11.303187+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T03:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T10:18:32.404248+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:18:49.620800+00:00","content_hash":"f47ed77c88b33600c20f732340f5bb181b5dc3a8dabd770055e7e5e1ee37238d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}